===
seed
Seeds the pseudo-random number generator with the given value.
Using the same seed produces the same sequence of random numbers.

seed(n)

seed(42)
===
random
Returns a pseudo-random number between 0 (inclusive) and 1 (exclusive).
Call seed() first to initialize the generator.

random()

seed(42)
random()    # 0.374540...
random()    # 0.950714...
